   "title": "SIMI summit reaches 1,000 people with health screenings, NHIS registrations in Bono",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/simi-summit-reaches-1000-people-with-health-screenings-nhis-registrations-in-bono/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
