   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription A college student was killed after being hit by the Vande Bharat Express near the Iringal railway gate between Vadakara and Payyoli in Kozhikode district on Tuesday (October 20, 2026) evening. Her body was handed over to her relatives after the post-mortem examination at Kozhikode District Hospital.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅后即可解锁这些内容 一名大学生在10月20日星期二晚上在科泽科德县瓦达卡拉和帕约利之间的伊林加尔铁路道口附近被万德巴拉特快车撞击后死亡。尸检在科泽科德地区医院进行后，其遗体已移交给亲属。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription A college student was killed after being hit by the Vande Bharat Express near the Iringal railway gate between Vadakara and Payyoli in Kozhikode district on Tuesday (October 20, 2026) evening. The deceased was identified as Nandana, a native of Iringal. She was studying at a college in Angamaly and had returned home for the holidays. According to police sources, the accident occurred while she was attempting to cross the railway tracks. The Vande Bharat Express, which was travelling towards Thiruvananthapuram, struck her, killing her on the spot, they said. Police and railway officials reached the spot and completed the inquest procedures. Her body was handed over to her relatives after the post-mortem examination at Kozhikode District Hospital. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
