   "title": "Mexico finally approves Reno Omokri’s appointment as Nigeria’s ambassador",
   "url": "https://www.thecable.ng/mexico-finally-approves-reno-omokris-appointment-as-nigerias-ambassador",
   "domain": "thecable.ng",
   "source": "TheCable（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Wed, 21 Oct 2026 08:06:16 GMT",
   "_dt": 1792569976.0,
   "ageDays": 0.54,
   "summary": "by Janefrances Chibundu October 21, 2026 9:06 am Reno Omokri Stay connected via Google News The Mexican government has finally approved Reno Omokri’s appointment as Nigeria’s ambassador to the country. In an X post on Tuesday, Omokri said José Manuel Briseño Flores, chargé d’affaires of the embassy of Mexico in Abuja, delivered the diplomatic approval, known as “agrément”, to Babagana Wakil, director of protocol at the ministry of foreign affairs.",
   "summary_zh": "珍妮弗朗西丝·奇本杜 2026年10月21日 上午9:06 雷诺·奥莫克里 通过谷歌新闻保持联系 墨西哥政府终于批准了雷诺·奥莫克里担任尼日利亚驻墨西哥大使的任命。奥莫克里周二在X平台发帖称，墨西哥驻阿布贾大使馆临时代办何塞·曼努埃尔·布里塞尼奥·弗洛雷斯向外交部礼宾司司长巴巴加纳·瓦基尔递交了称为“agrément”的外交批准文件。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "by Janefrances Chibundu October 21, 2026 9:06 am Reno Omokri Stay connected via Google News The Mexican government has finally approved Reno Omokri’s appointment as Nigeria’s ambassador to the country. In an X post on Tuesday, Omokri said José Manuel Briseño Flores, chargé d’affaires of the embassy of Mexico in Abuja, delivered the diplomatic approval, known as “agrément”, to Babagana Wakil, director of protocol at the ministry of foreign affairs. He said the approval covers his appointment as Nigeria’s ambassador extraordinary and plenipotentiary to Mexico, with concurrent accreditation to Guatemala, Honduras and Nicaragua. “To God be the glory, the Chargé d’affaires of the Embassy of the United Mexican States in Abuja, Mr José Manuel Briseño Flores, today in Abuja delivered the agrément from the Government of the United Mexican States accepting me,” Omokri said. The approval ended eight months of uncertainty over Omokri’s diplomatic posting. In March, President Bola Tinubu approved the posting of 65 ambassadors-designate and high commissioners to their respective countries, assigning Omokri to Mexico. However, his posting was pending, with the Mexican government not immediately granting the required diplomatic approval. In August, the ministry said Mexico and Japan were among the countries yet to communicate formal acceptance of two outstanding ambassadorial appointments. The ministry said it was engaging the relevant authorities and expressed confidence that the outstanding approvals would be conveyed in due course. Agrément is the formal consent a host country gives before an ambassador nominated by another country can be appointed to serve there",
