   "ageDays": 1.05,
   "summary": "President Bola Ahmed Tinubu has expressed sadness over the news of the passing of Pa Reuben Famuyide Fasoranti, who died at the age of 100. He said on behalf of the Federal Government and the people of Nigeria, “I commiserate with the Fasoranti family, the good people of Akure Kingdom, the government and people of Ondo State and South-West Nigeria, and the entire Afenifere family.",
   "summary_zh": "总统博拉·艾哈迈德·蒂努布对鲁本·法穆伊德·法索兰蒂去世的消息表示悲痛，法索兰蒂享年100岁。他代表联邦政府和尼日利亚人民表示，“我向法索兰蒂家族、阿库雷王国的善良人民、翁多州政府和人民、西南尼日利亚以及整个阿费尼费雷家族表示慰问。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "President Bola Ahmed Tinubu has expressed sadness over the news of the passing of Pa Reuben Famuyide Fasoranti, who died at the age of 100. He said on behalf of the Federal Government and the people of Nigeria, “I commiserate with the Fasoranti family, the good people of Akure Kingdom, the government and people of Ondo State and South-West Nigeria, and the entire Afenifere family. The statement said Fasoranti’s life, spanning a century, was a lesson in integrity, discipline, selflessness, and unwavering commitment to the Yoruba people and the unity and progress of Nigeria. “From his days as an educationist and principal, to his stewardship as Commissioner for Finance in the old Ondo State, and later as the leader of Afenifere, Baba never wavered in his belief in true federalism, social justice, and a Nigeria that works for all. “Baba made immense contributions to this country and, at the risk of his life, fought for the democracy we enjoy today. “Pa Fasoranti distinguished himself in every respect: in his disciplined, Spartan way of life, his belief in principles, and his commitment to noble causes. The President recalled Baba’s centenary on May 11 this year, when he celebrated not just longevity, but a legacy of honour. “He lived a fulfilled life and left indelible footprints in the sands of time.” He also recalled his prayers and counsel when “I came to his residence in Akure in 2022 to inform him of my decision to contest the presidency. Pa Fasoranti told me I would be President in his lifetime, and God answered his prayer. “I had hoped Papa would also be around with us for my second term to witness the full dawn of economic growth and prosperity in the land. But we must thank God for Pa Fasoranti’s long life of service, grace and fulfilment.” Join Daily Trust WhatsApp Community For Quick Access To News and Happenings Around You",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "ng"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "pol"
   ],
   "tier": 3,
   "actor": "当事国政府",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
   "usHit": false,
   "terrHit": false,
   "score": 0.6,
   "tag": "rss_dailytrust",
   "title_zh": "蒂努布：我希望法索兰蒂能活着看到我的第二个任期",
   "body_zh": "总统博拉·艾哈迈德·蒂努布对帕·鲁本·法穆伊德·法索兰蒂逝世的消息表示悲痛，他于100岁高龄去世。他代表联邦政府和尼日利亚人民说，“我向法索兰蒂家族、阿库雷王国的善良人民、翁多州政府和人民、西南尼日利亚以及整个阿费尼费雷家族表示慰问。该声明称，法索兰蒂跨越一个世纪的人生，是正直、纪律、无私以及对约鲁巴人民和尼日利亚的团结与进步坚定不移的承诺的典范。“从他担任教育工作者和校长的日子，到他在旧翁多州担任财政专员，以及后来担任阿费尼费雷领导人的时期，爸爸从未动摇过他对真正联邦制、社会正义以及一个为所有人服务的尼日利亚的信念。“爸爸为这个国家做出了巨大贡献，并冒着生命危险，为我们今天享有的民主而奋斗。“帕·法索兰蒂在各方面都表现出色：在他自律、简朴的生活方式中，他对原则的信念，以及他对崇高事业的承诺。总统回忆起爸爸今年5月11日的百岁诞辰，当时他庆祝的不仅仅是长寿，而是一份荣誉的遗产。“他过着充实的生活，并在时间的沙滩上留下了不可磨灭的足迹。”他还回忆起当“我2022年前往他在阿库雷的住所，告知他我决定竞选总统时”他的祈祷和建议。帕·法索兰蒂告诉我，我将在他有生之年成为总统，而上帝回应了他的祈祷。“我曾希望爸爸也能和我们一起度过我的第二个任期，见证这片土地上经济增长和繁荣的全面到来。但我们必须感谢上帝，感谢帕·法索兰蒂漫长的一生服务、恩典和圆满。”加入Daily Trust WhatsApp社区，快速获取您周围的新闻和动态",
