   "title": "918658 efcc emefiele differ over evidence in alleged fraudulent 6 23m cbn withdrawal contract fraud trial",
   "url": "https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/top-news/918658-efcc-emefiele-differ-over-evidence-in-alleged-fraudulent-6-23m-cbn-withdrawal-contract-fraud-trial.html",
