   "title": "Tinubu mourns Fasoranti, says Nigeria lost pillar of democracy",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/10/tinubu-mourns-fasoranti-says-nigeria-lost-pillar-of-democracy/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
