   "title": "Jihadists blamed for Mali attack, 48 dead: sources",
   "url": "https://www.modernghana.com/news/1537773/jihadists-blamed-for-mali-attack-48-dead-sources.amp",
   "domain": "modernghana.com",
   "source": "modernghana.com",
