   "title": "Bandits Abduct 5 Persons, Including 1-Month-Old Baby In Kaduna",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/bandits-abduct-5-persons-including-one-month-old-baby-in-kaduna/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
   "source": "Leadership（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:16:29 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792494989.0,
   "ageDays": 1.41,
   "summary": "in Mararaban Kajuru of Kufana ward, Kajuru LGA, Kaduna State, 5 people have been confirmed kidnapped by terrorists, including a child of 1 month old, within the past few weeks this morning. As of the time of filing this report, neither the Kaduna State Police Command nor the state Ministry of Internal Security and Home Affairs had issued an official statement on the incident.",
   "summary_zh": "在卡杜纳州卡朱鲁地方政府卡富纳区的马拉拉班·卡朱鲁，过去几周内有5人被恐怖分子确认绑架，其中包括一名1个月大的婴儿。截至本报告提交时，卡杜纳州警察指挥部和州内部安全与内政部均未就该事件发表官方声明。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The victims were reportedly kidnapped at about 1:00 a.m. on Tuesday, October 20, 2026, in Mararaban Kajuru, Kufana Ward. A community security update circulating on Tuesday disclosed the incident, raising concerns over the safety of the victims. The update read in part, “At about 1a.m. in Mararaban Kajuru of Kufana ward, Kajuru LGA, Kaduna State, 5 people have been confirmed kidnapped by terrorists, including a child of 1 month old, within the past few weeks this morning. However, the update did not provide details of how the abduction occurred or disclose the identities of the victims. As of the time of filing this report, neither the Kaduna State Police Command nor the state Ministry of Internal Security and Home Affairs had issued an official statement on the incident. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "ng"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "sec",
    "pol"
   ],
   "tier": 3,
   "actor": "当事国政府",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
   "usHit": false,
   "terrHit": false,
   "score": 0.6,
   "tag": "rss_leadership",
   "title_zh": "土匪在卡杜纳绑架5人，包括一名1个月大的婴儿",
   "body_zh": "据报道，受害者于2026年10月20日星期二凌晨1:00左右在库法纳区马拉拉班卡朱鲁被绑架。周二流传的一份社区安全更新披露了这一事件，引发了对受害者安全的担忧。该更新部分内容写道：“今天上午，在卡杜纳州卡朱鲁地方政府区库法纳区的马拉拉班卡朱鲁，大约凌晨1点，确认有5人被恐怖分子绑架，其中包括一名1个月大的婴儿。然而，该更新没有提供绑架如何发生的细节，也没有披露受害者的身份。截至本报告撰写时，卡杜纳州警察指挥部和州内部安全与内政部均未就该事件发表官方声明。我们拥有优势。获取实时报道、突发独家新闻和独家视角，直接发送到您的手机。不要满足于过时的新闻。加入LEADERSHIP NEWS的WhatsApp，获取24/7更新→",
