   "published": "Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:40:18 +0530",
   "_dt": 1792494618.0,
   "ageDays": 1.42,
   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription The Tamil Nadu All Farmers’ Association Coordination Committee has urged the State government to find a solution to the issues faced by tenant farmers. Pandian said the tenant farmers were unable to avail the benefits of welfare schemes for farmers implemented by the governments at the Centre and in the State and as well as faced difficulty in availing crop loans and fertilisers from cooperative societies.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅后解锁 泰米尔纳德邦全体农民协会协调委员会敦促州政府为佃农面临的问题找到解决方案。潘迪安说，佃农无法获得中央和州政府实施的农民福利计划的福利，并且在从合作社获得作物贷款和化肥方面也面临困难。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription The Tamil Nadu All Farmers’ Association Coordination Committee has urged the State government to find a solution to the issues faced by tenant farmers. In a statement on October 20, Co-ordinator of the Committee P.R. Pandian said the tenant farmers were unable to avail the benefits of welfare schemes for farmers implemented by the governments at the Centre and in the State and as well as faced difficulty in availing crop loans and fertilisers from cooperative societies. He urged the Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam-led State government to come to the rescue of the tenant farmers by securing exemption to the latter through the courts so that the tenant farmers could avail the benefits of government welfare schemes for farmers and crop loans. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
