   "title": "Ogoni Oil: Disability Group Demands Fair Share of NNPC Jobs",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/20/ogoni-oil-disability-group-demands-fair-share-of-nnpc-jobs/",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
   "source": "ThisDay（尼日利亚）",
