   "_dt": 1792490403.0,
   "ageDays": 1.47,
   "summary": "While Shroff escaped without injuries, his driver and another bystander sustained injuries during the shooting. Police stated that while the motorcycle used in the attack was recovered in Mumbai, no weapons have been retrieved from the suspects as investigations into the motive behind the shooting continue. Eknath Shinde, Deputy Chief Minister of Maharashtra, visited the actor following the incident and expressed concern over the attack.",
   "summary_zh": "虽然施罗夫在袭击中没有受伤，但他的司机和另一名旁观者在枪击中受伤。警方表示，虽然用于袭击的摩托车已在孟买找到，但尚未从嫌疑人处收缴武器，对枪击动机背后的调查仍在继续。马哈拉施特拉邦副首席部长埃克纳特·辛德在事件发生后探访了这位演员，并对袭击表示担忧。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The 36-year-old movie star was leaving a football ground in the Juhu suburb on Sunday evening when assailants targeted his car. While Shroff escaped without injuries, his driver and another bystander sustained injuries during the shooting. Video footage from the scene captured at least two men firing multiple shots at close range toward the front passenger seat as the vehicle moved through a crowd. Raj Tilak Roshan, Deputy Commissioner of Police for the Mumbai crime branch, confirmed that law enforcement officers arrested three suspects aged 18, 22, and 22 in connection with the incident. Police stated that while the motorcycle used in the attack was recovered in Mumbai, no weapons have been retrieved from the suspects as investigations into the motive behind the shooting continue. Eknath Shinde, Deputy Chief Minister of Maharashtra, visited the actor following the incident and expressed concern over the attack. The All Indian Cine Workers Association (AICWA) issued a statement post on x condemning the shooting, calling on government authorities to enhance security measures for film industry personalities against extortion and threats. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
