   "summary": "US Ambassador to India Sergio Gor arrived in Mumbai on Tuesday alongside US Secretary of State Marco Rubio, saying he looked forward to a “productive visit” to advance India-US ties. Marco Rubio India visit LIVE: Maharashtra Chief Minister Devendra Fadnavis was seen with US Secretary of State Marco Rubio at Mumbai's iconic Gateway of India. Marco Rubio India visit LIVE: US secretary of state Marco Rubio arrived at Mumbai's Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport on Tuesday.",
   "summary_zh": "美国驻印度大使塞尔吉奥·戈尔周二与美国国务卿马可·鲁比奥一同抵达孟买，他表示期待一次“富有成效的访问”以推进印美关系。马可·鲁比奥印度访问直播：马哈拉施特拉邦首席部长德文德拉·法德纳维斯在孟买标志性的印度门与美国国务卿马可·鲁比奥会面。马可·鲁比奥印度访问直播：美国国务卿马可·鲁比奥于周二抵达孟买的贾特拉帕蒂·希瓦吉·马哈拉杰国际机场。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "India and the US are expected to explore ways to strengthen cooperation in key areas, including defence, security, technology and critical minerals, when External Affairs Minister S Jaishankar meets US Secretary of State Marco Rubio in Mumbai on Tuesday, amid continuing strains in bilateral ties. Rubio's schedule today Rubio arrived at Mumbai's Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport. He is scheduled to lay a wreath at the Taj Memorial at the Taj Mahal Palace hotel at 3.40 pm, followed by a meeting with External Affairs Minister S Jaishankar at the same venue at 3.50 pm. Later in the day, Rubio will attend the Freedom 250 reception at the Jio World Convention Centre at 6.35 pm. Marco Rubio India visit LIVE: US Ambassador to India Sergio Gor arrived in Mumbai on Tuesday alongside US Secretary of State Marco Rubio, saying he looked forward to a “productive visit” to advance India-US ties. In a post on X, Gor said, “Great to be back in Mumbai, this time with my friend @SecRubio. Looking forward to a productive visit and to advancing U.S.-India ties.” In another post on X, the US envoy welcomed Rubio, who arrived in Mumbai with his wife, Jeanette Dousdebes Rubio. Rubio is scheduled to hold bilateral talks with External Affairs Minister S Jaishankar during his visit. Marco Rubio India visit LIVE: Maharashtra Chief Minister Devendra Fadnavis was seen with US Secretary of State Marco Rubio at Mumbai's iconic Gateway of India. US Ambassador to India Sergio Gor was also present. Marco Rubio India visit LIVE: US secretary of state Marco Rubio arrived at Mumbai's Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport on Tuesday. He is scheduled to lay a wreath at the Taj Memorial at the Taj Mahal Palace hotel at 3.40 pm, before meeting External Affairs Minister S Jaishankar at the same venue at 3.50 pm. Later in the day, Rubio will attend the Freedom 250 reception at the Jio World Convention Centre at 6.35 pm",
