   "title": "FMBN Approves N208bn In Housing Loans, Funds 6,911 Homes In 2025",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/fmbn-approves-n208bn-in-housing-loans-funds-6911-homes-in-2025/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
