   "snippet": "This is absolutely wrong!\n\nThe AES countries (Mali, Niger & Burkina Faso) aren't seeking a return to the ECOWAS bloc. What occurred between the two parties was a dialogue to forge a path to mutual cooperation.\n\nAs a matter of fact, realities kept the two sides talking despite the AES States withdrawal from ECOWAS in January 2025. From the outcome of the dialogue, both parties emphasized they want a balanced, realistic framework that protects their peoples’ interests\n\nWhat occurred was a step towards the formalization of a co-existential two-bloc region, and not a step towards the re-integration of AES into ECOWAS.\n\nWe can play politics without distorting facts and truths.",
