   "platform": "x",
   "title": "Fact check: Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso did leave ECOWAS.",
   "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2112594821667852567",
   "snippet": "Fact check:\n\nMali, Niger and Burkina Faso did leave ECOWAS. They announced withdrawal in January 2024; it took effect 29 January 2025. They formed the AES/Confederation of Sahel States.\n\nThe claim that they are now “begging to return” is false. On 17 October 2026 they held ministerial talks with ECOWAS in Dakar to negotiate a cooperation framework on trade and free movement while remaining separate. AES foreign ministers explicitly ruled out rejoining, calling speculation “no truth.”\n\nThe “Obidients hailed them / to hell with ECOWAS” part is an unverified partisan generalisation with no clear documented evidence of the movement making that collective statement.",
   "body": "Fact check:\n\nMali, Niger and Burkina Faso did leave ECOWAS. They announced withdrawal in January 2024; it took effect 29 January 2025. They formed the AES/Confederation of Sahel States.\n\nThe claim that they are now “begging to return” is false. On 17 October 2026 they held ministerial talks with ECOWAS in Dakar to negotiate a cooperation framework on trade and free movement while remaining separate. AES foreign ministers explicitly ruled out rejoining, calling speculation “no truth.”\n\nThe “Obidients hailed them / to hell with ECOWAS” part is an unverified partisan generalisation with no clear documented evidence of the movement making that collective statement.",
