   "title": "𝟵. 🏗️ 𝗧𝘂𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗹 𝗘𝗣𝗖: 𝗟&𝗧, 𝗔𝗳𝗰𝗼𝗻𝘀, 𝗝 𝗞𝘂𝗺𝗮𝗿, 𝗛𝗖𝗖, 𝗣𝗮𝘁𝗲𝗹 𝗘𝗻𝗴𝗴 🔁 These are India's tunnel-heavy contractors. Afcons alone planned ~20 TBMs in FY24",
   "url": "https://x.com/CaVivekkhatri/status/2112555723125395837",
   "snippet": "𝟵. 🏗️ 𝗧𝘂𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗹 𝗘𝗣𝗖: 𝗟&𝗧, 𝗔𝗳𝗰𝗼𝗻𝘀, 𝗝 𝗞𝘂𝗺𝗮𝗿, 𝗛𝗖𝗖, 𝗣𝗮𝘁𝗲𝗹 𝗘𝗻𝗴𝗴\n\n🔁 These are India's tunnel-heavy contractors. Afcons alone planned ~20 TBMs in FY24\n🔁 Chinese-made TBMs have worked on Indian metros before (e.g. CRCHI machines for Bangalore Metro, 2020)\n📉 Risk: spares, main drives and refurbishing for any China-made machines in their fleets\n✅ Offset: Herrenknecht has built Indian metro TBMs at its Chennai facility\n\nExposure depends on the fleet, not the headline.\n\n🔎 𝙒𝙖𝙩𝙘𝙝: Fleet-origin disclosures in Q2 FY27 concalls\n\n9/16",
   "body": "𝟵. 🏗️ 𝗧𝘂𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗹 𝗘𝗣𝗖: 𝗟&𝗧, 𝗔𝗳𝗰𝗼𝗻𝘀, 𝗝 𝗞𝘂𝗺𝗮𝗿, 𝗛𝗖𝗖, 𝗣𝗮𝘁𝗲𝗹 𝗘𝗻𝗴𝗴\n\n🔁 These are India's tunnel-heavy contractors. Afcons alone planned ~20 TBMs in FY24\n🔁 Chinese-made TBMs have worked on Indian metros before (e.g. CRCHI machines for Bangalore Metro, 2020)\n📉 Risk: spares, main drives and refurbishing for any China-made machines in their fleets\n✅ Offset: Herrenknecht has built Indian metro TBMs at its Chennai facility\n\nExposure depends on the fleet, not the headline.\n\n🔎 𝙒𝙖𝙩𝙘𝙝: Fleet-origin disclosures in Q2 FY27 concalls\n\n9/16",
