   "url": "https://x.com/TV5NewsPH/status/2112549390040883708",
   "snippet": "‘SEND THIS POOR VERSION OF FOREIGN GUEST, THIS HOOLIGAN BACK HOME’\n\nHinikayat ni Sen. Kiko Pangilinan si Pres. Bongbong Marcos na pauwiin si Chinese Ambassador to the Philippines Jing Quan sa China kasunod ng mga kontrobersiyal na pahayag ng diplomat.\n\nPara sa senador, kung nagawa ng PBBM administration na ipakulong sina dating pangulong Rodrigo Duterte, Pastor Apollo Quiboloy, at dating House speaker Martin Romualdez, ipagbawal ang Philippine Offshore Gaming Operators (POGO), at igiit ang soberanya ng bansa laban sa Chinese aggression, kaya rin nitong pabalikin ng China si Quan.\n\n“I have witnessed and thus know that you have what it takes, Mr President. But if you don’t use it, you lose it,” ani Pangilinan.",
