   "title": "🚨 CHINA’S ILLEGAL PRESENCE PERSISTS AT SCARBOROUGH SHOAL, BUT THE PHILIPPINES REMAINS VIGILANT.",
   "url": "https://x.com/BRPSierraMadre/status/2112426696804884853",
   "snippet": "🚨 CHINA’S ILLEGAL PRESENCE PERSISTS AT SCARBOROUGH SHOAL, BUT THE PHILIPPINES REMAINS VIGILANT.\n\nChina speaks of peace, yet its actions at sea tell another story.\n\nDuring a Philippine Coast Guard maritime domain awareness flight over Bajo de Masinloc, radio challenges involving Philippine and Chinese military aircraft and vessels were already being heard before the shoal was reached.\n\nThe mission also spotted two buoys and a floating barrier still in place, along with a Chinese research vessel, a PLA Navy warship, and a Chinese maritime militia vessel operating outside the shoal.\n\nThe Philippines continues to monitor the situation, document maritime activities, and assert its rights under international law.\n\nBajo de Masinloc is more than a point on the map. It represents the Philippines’ determination to protect its maritime rights against persistent pressure and intimidation.\n\n🇵🇭 The Philippines remains watchful. Its maritime rights must be respected.\n\n#BRPSierraMadre #WPS #WestPhilippineSea #PhilippineSovereignty #RuleOfLaw #KnowTheTactics #StandForThePhilippines #MaritimeSecurity #UNCLOS #SovereignRights #NotOneMore #BajoDeMasinloc #PhilippineCoastGuard #MaritimeSecurity",
