   "snippet": "🇬🇭🌍GHANA IS OPEN FOR INVESTMENT THAT BUILDS INDUSTRY, EMPOWERS PEOPLE AND TRANSFORMS THE FUTURE\n\n“Ghana welcomes investors ready to build the future with us. Successful partnerships must strengthen enterprise, transfer knowledge, and create opportunities beyond just extraction.”\n\n— President John Dramani Mahama, speaking at the African Minerals Policy Forum – Mining in Motion (AMPF–MiM) 2026 in Accra.\n\nGhana’s vision for the mining sector goes beyond extracting natural resources. It is about forging strategic partnerships that drive local value addition, strengthen domestic industries, transfer technology and expertise, create meaningful jobs, and expand opportunities for businesses and communities.\n\nTHE FUTURE OF MINING MUST BE BUILT ON PARTNERSHIPS THAT DELIVER LASTING VALUE FOR GHANA AND ITS PEOPLE.",
   "body": "🇬🇭🌍GHANA IS OPEN FOR INVESTMENT THAT BUILDS INDUSTRY, EMPOWERS PEOPLE AND TRANSFORMS THE FUTURE\n\n“Ghana welcomes investors ready to build the future with us. Successful partnerships must strengthen enterprise, transfer knowledge, and create opportunities beyond just extraction.”\n\n— President John Dramani Mahama, speaking at the African Minerals Policy Forum – Mining in Motion (AMPF–MiM) 2026 in Accra.\n\nGhana’s vision for the mining sector goes beyond extracting natural resources. It is about forging strategic partnerships that drive local value addition, strengthen domestic industries, transfer technology and expertise, create meaningful jobs, and expand opportunities for businesses and communities.\n\nTHE FUTURE OF MINING MUST BE BUILT ON PARTNERSHIPS THAT DELIVER LASTING VALUE FOR GHANA AND ITS PEOPLE.",
